    "description": {
      "value": "A bullhook is a stout rod about 4 feet long with a blunt hook on the end. Too dull to be useful as a weapon, a bullhook is instead used to direct animals in training or in performing their tasks. A bullhook grants you an item bonus to Nature checks to Command an Animal while you are holding it.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou wave the bullhook to produce the effects of a command spell. This spell loses the linguistic trait and can target only animals.\n\nThe item bonus is +2, the command spell is 1st level, and the DC is 18."
    },
